    "title": "Lady Trojans fall to Veterans Memorial in straight sets - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Coy Slavik ,\n1 days ago BEEVILLE — The Beeville Lady Trojans fell to Corpus Christi Veterans Memorial in straight sets Tuesday, Sept. 1, dropping a 25-23, 25-16, 25-11 decision at home. Isabella Weathers led the Lady Trojans offensively with eight kills and also contributed 10 digs and two aces. Danika Gonzales finished with five... Read full article\n1",
